    "comment": "DISPATCHCONSTRAINT sets out details of all binding and interregion constraints in each dispatch run. Note: invoked constraints can be established from GENCONSETINVOKE. Binding constraints show as marginal value >$0. Interconnector constraints are listed so RHS (SCADA calculated limits) can be reported.",
